这是小说对私人利益与公共资源的场景展示，不能把他们谈出的数字直接当作历史贸易定额；也不能在尚未收到后续账册前声称死者家属必然分不到任何钱。","confidence":"MEDIUM","verification_state":"PROVISIONAL"}],"fixture_only":false,"reader_session_id":"v13-r007-20261009-wanming-full-paragraph-039","round_id":"R007","paragraph_normalization":"xhtml_visible_text_trim_whitespace_v1"}
